This layout is a fork of the Traveler layout for Herdr
(https://github.com/franky5440-afk/herdr-traveler), Copyright 2026 Frank Lin,
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Its mods traveler-chrome, traveler-spaces,
traveler-agents, traveler-tabs and inbox became polyflow-chrome, polyflow-spaces,
polyflow-agents, polyflow-tabs and polyflow-inbox here. They were modified: renamed,
retinted for the PolyFlow palette, cyberpunk archetypes and buildings instead of
fantasy jobs and places, opaque card hovers, and a Windows branch for the inbox
(PowerShell listing, rundll32 opening).

Traveler's polyflow-spaces, polyflow-tabs and polyflow-chrome ancestors are in turn
derived from the built-in mods spaces, tabs and workspace-chrome of Herdr 0.1.11
(Apache License 2.0).

